  "//geometry": [
    "A hub with four wings. The hub is the only place the wings touch, so the",
    "level graph is a star and the keycards are its edges:",
    "",
    "  HUB               x 40..56  z 40..56  floor y7  ceiling y18  (spawn)",
    "  NORTH  (open)     -> the BLUE keycard, plus a dead-end armoury and secret 1",
    "  WEST   (BLUE)     -> the YELLOW keycard, plus a vault behind secret 2",
    "  EAST   (YELLOW)   -> the RED keycard, on a gantry over a lava moat",
    "  SOUTH  (RED)      -> the exit hall, its switch, and the way out",
    "",
    "  NC-a  x 47..49  z 28..39   hub -> north junction",
    "  NJ    x 40..56  z 22..27   north junction, two ways on",
    "  NC-b  x 40..42  z 10..21   west branch",
    "  NR    x 24..44  z  4.. 9   blue keycard room",
    "  NC-c  x 54..56  z 10..21   east branch",
    "  ND    x 50..66  z  4.. 9   armoury dead end",
    "  S1    x 68..71  z  5.. 8   secret 1, behind a fake wall at x 67",
    "  WC-a  x 26..38  z 46..48   blue door -> west chamber",
    "  WJ    x 10..25  z 40..54   yellow keycard chamber",
    "  S2    x  3.. 8  z 44..50   secret 2, behind a fake wall at x 9",
    "  EC-a  x 58..70  z 46..48   yellow door -> east hall",
    "  ER    x 71..91  z 36..58   red keycard hall, lava moat, gantry to y10",
    "  SC    x 47..49  z 58..70   red door -> south",
    "  SR    x 34..62  z 71..90   exit hall, exit switch on the south wall"
  ],

